# Python service

Quality thresholds: **`quality-and-testing.mdc`**. API/HTTP semantics: **`api-and-events.mdc`**. Security: **`security-baseline.mdc`**. Pins: `.agents-v0/packs/python/PACK.md`.

## Source layout

A new service is FastAPI under the backend root: `app/api`, `app/service`, `app/repository`, `app/domain`. Alembic migrations live in `alembic/versions`. An existing Django app keeps its layout. Do not add FastAPI beside Django, or `pom.xml`, or a Node service.

## Shape

- Routers depend on services through function arguments. No hidden globals for the database or the current user.
- Routers validate a Pydantic model and call the service. Do not return ORM entities.
- SQLAlchemy uses bound parameters. Sort and filter fields come from an allowlist.
- Log with the standard logger. Do not interpolate secrets into the message. Do not log tokens or raw PII.
- No bare `except`. Functions ≤ 30 lines.
- Correlation id and `traceparent` on every request.
